37514>>>>>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent Zoom from a Zoom.
37514>>>>>>>                Case Break
37515>>>>>>>
37515>>>>>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
37515>>>>>>>
37515>>>>>>>        Case End
37515>>>>>>>
37515>>>>>>>        Send SetActionButtons
