37816>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
37817>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
37818>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
37819>>>>>>>        End
