38156>>>>>>>        Else Begin
38157>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38158>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38159>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38160>>>>>>>        End
