38987>>>Object oDashboard is a cWebView
38989>>>
38989>>>    // - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -  
38989>>>    // Add a DDO Structure 
38989>>>    //
38989>>>    // There is no need to synchronize a DD structure on the client so we do
38989>>>    // not set the Server property or send ADDOStructure. We will simply use
38989>>>    // DDO's to mine data and generate HTML for our cWebHTMLBox objects.
38989>>>    // It is the HTML in these objects that is sent to the client each time 
38989>>>    // this page is shown.
38989>>>    //
38989>>>    // Also, it is important for the drill-down Navigation interface that we
38989>>>    // do not set the Server property to some DDO because this will affect 
38989>>>    // constraints in the next view that we navigate to.
38989>>>    // - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - 
38989>>>
38989>>>    Set piMaxWidth to 1024
38990>>>    
38990>>>    Set psCaption to "Dashboard"
38991>>>    Set peViewType to vtUndefined
38992>>>    Set pbShowCaption to False
38993>>>    Set psCSSClass to "Dashboard"
38994>>>    
